From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arian <arian.kulmer@web.de>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 11:47:03 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Support third party galleries

Adapted for MiuiCamera 6.4.000370.0 (fuxi OS3.0.306.0.WMCMIXM).

Original upstream patches (kunzite-stuff/device_xiaomi_kunzite-miuicamera@cnb):
  0008-Change-com.android.camera.action.REVIEW-to-android.p.patch
  0009-Support-third-party-galleries.patch

MiuiCamera hardcodes com.miui.gallery both as the intent package and as the
action namespace. com.miui.gallery is not shipped by PixelOS, so the preview
button throws ActivityNotFoundException and falls back to the chooser.

Changes:
  - A/e3.smali: use android.provider.action.REVIEW instead of
    com.android.camera.action.REVIEW, and drop the hardcoded
    setPackage("com.miui.gallery").
  - Camera.smali: use android.intent.category.APP_GALLERY instead of the
    com.miui.gallery package name, android.intent.action.VIEW instead of
    com.miui.gallery.action.VIEW_EMPTY_PHOTO, and addCategory() instead of
    setPackage().

Not carried over from 0009: the smali_classes2/C9/d.smali hunk
(`const/4 v3, 0x4` -> `0x2`). That class does not exist in 6.4.000370.0.

